•	Receiver will send NAK(401)
•	Transmitter tries to replay 401
•	But 401 is missing from replay buffer ❌
Now what?
👉 Transmitter cannot retransmit required TLP
👉 Protocol violation
👉 Replay logic stuck
👉 Eventually link goes to Recovery
This causes:
•	Replay timeout continuously
•	Replay storm
•	LTSSM entering Recovery repeatedly
